{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1794.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"dd04218d9b89e9df419d6d4824c8018fbc645133e238ab6df46118d903f35bb9","ja":"だれにも負けない！","zh":"绝不输给任何人！","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1794.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"39352858285bfb6ed99a87cbb8887c4d1f720d386e077249dfa5fcbf6d64cc9d","ja":"でもやっぱり、生クリーム飲み対決、\nやりたいな～。どうしたらできるかな？","zh":"不过我还是想来一场喝鲜奶油比赛啊～。要怎么做才行呢？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1794.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"404cb5dfc8283f572d52f4f5f794e70fe67ee4558620bcfa1f543f3d5486af8d","ja":"そうねえ……劇場の配信企画としてなら、\n実現できるかも。","zh":"是啊……如果作为剧场的直播企划，\n说不定可以实现。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1794.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"221b079af16619c836abdfd5c4e3661a678d2be59396957cfbc8dea20f81646b","ja":"今度、●●●●プロデューサーさんに\n相談してみましょうか？","zh":"下次要不要去和●●●●制作人商量一下？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1794.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"433645fa4d11e36ce46cd13e27edfa2650dc83185c30d308c372d1a55353a4a3","ja":"わ～い！！　それなら、できそうですね♪","zh":"好耶！！这样的话，应该能做到呢♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1794.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"3699770f46fab2469fb9009e0e7587df516c5979ffee89cd64fb984a889affc2","ja":"それじゃあ、今から練習しなきゃ！\n生クリームたっぷりのケーキ、おかわりしよーっと♪","zh":"那现在就得开始练习了！\n再来一块满满都是鲜奶油的蛋糕吧♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1794.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"204dcece9fdec5516998e303a0820b30b853e91bbad6bc2f2335bf56726d9a5f","ja":"あっ。未来ちゃん待ってー！\nわたしもおかわりするー♪","zh":"啊，未来，等等我——！\n我也要再来一份♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1794.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"72ece2dc5e3cae5616871a837e1382ea497ca35b2f7c8843c2137b8fb8740f7a","ja":"もう、言ってるそばから騒がしくして……。\nまだ企画が通るかもわからないのに。","zh":"这才刚说完就闹腾起来了……\n明明还不知道企划能不能通过。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1794.unity3d","item_key":"commands[39].text","source_sha256":"1284934419ea900a8b24f16dff4942fcfaae9c55a61f1e23c40f157589903244","ja":"●●●●プロデューサーのことですし、\nよほど変な内容でなければ許可は出ると思いますわよ。","zh":"毕竟是●●●●制作人，只要内容不是特别奇怪，我想应该会获准的。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1794.unity3d","item_key":"commands[40].text","source_sha256":"71d98bf4858d01a2c1b576827859ad631d0dc895866f11eea0f5056a9e616523","ja":"そうだねぇ。あたしも練習したいから、\nもう少し、ケーキをもらってこようかな？","zh":"是啊。我也想练习一下，要不要再去拿点蛋糕来？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1794.unity3d","item_key":"commands[41].text","source_sha256":"94cd3940566c4e62fc640bc3222d92b21e316534d61e74f0755e1beefe3f913e","ja":"あら、それならわたくしも。\n気になるケーキがまだありましたし。","zh":"哎呀，那我也要。\n还有一块让人在意的蛋糕。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1794.unity3d","item_key":"commands[42].text","source_sha256":"03b844bad9969a9431180e0460527191e963fa0be424e483b8dfc670175f8464","ja":"ふふっ。みんな、やる気満々ね。\n連勝中の志保ちゃんも、次は危ないかしら？","zh":"呵呵，大家都干劲十足呢。\n连胜中的志保，下一场也许要危险了吧？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1794.unity3d","item_key":"commands[50].text","source_sha256":"28eb3f04c74fd1ea93fb21c261f9628d6c2339c88381238d19bd769f63af2eef","ja":"どうでしょう？\n企画でしたら、負けないように頑張りますけど。","zh":"怎么样？\n如果是企划的话，我会努力不输给别人。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1794.unity3d","item_key":"commands[51].text","source_sha256":"0da2c16436bc13ff3e5004b7d1363f6aeded115a14458daa760bffaf8bc454ff","ja":"……やっぱり、私もケーキを取ってきます。\n少しでも、研究しておきたいので。","zh":"……我还是也去拿块蛋糕吧。\n因为哪怕只有一点，我也想先研究一下。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1794.unity3d","item_key":"commands[60].text","source_sha256":"431e9c13c9ff3d9915ec1dd1b46151da7212c62eed6bbbf92b8cc2e26386be28","ja":"ふふ、さすがは志保ちゃんね。\n私も負けられないわ！","zh":"呵呵，不愧是志保。\n我也不能输！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1794.unity3d","item_key":"commands[61].text","source_sha256":"e4ad6bab59bc23ee04a9b458eed5d8452cf6ce8659508d8aec45a6a4b0700c71","ja":"ええ、まったくですわ。\nセレブの底力、見せて差し上げましてよ！","zh":"是的，确实如此。\n让我展现一下名媛的真正实力吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1794.unity3d","item_key":"commands[62].text","source_sha256":"585962348936547c8dd81c107ff1bdbf47079f170d2cfa6c90f7bbb588ea754e","ja":"あたしも頑張るよぉ。\n今度こそ、志保ちゃんに勝ってみせるべさ！","zh":"我也会加油的哦。\n这次我一定要赢过志保！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
